# Claude Code — never commit per-user state (memory / personal rules / local settings).
# Personal subpaths only, so team .claude/{settings.json,hooks,commands} can still be committed.
.claude/memory/
.claude/projects/
.claude/rules/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
